= Install the bundle

:::: tabs
::: tab "Composer"
Run `composer require markup-carve/symfony-carve:dev-main`.
:::

::: tab "Configuration"
Register `CarveBundle` in `config/bundles.php`.
:::
::::

== Linking

See :wiki[Getting Started] for the first steps.

Bare address: https://markup-carve.github.io/carve/ and an autolink <https://github.com/markup-carve/symfony-carve>.
